  "task": {
    "objective": "Charge all three receivers to three. Each role gains more from its own receiver; launch credit and the shared completion bonus create additional motives to assist.",
    "natural_termination": "All receiver charges equal three. Otherwise truncate at 96 nonterminal steps. Natural success takes precedence on the horizon; terminal raw calls are absorbing and reward zero.",
    "interaction": "A shared movable-worker optical board. Adjacent workers turn or clamp the same mirrors, spending common energy. Pulses take one cell per tick, reflect at actual mirror cells, and are consumed by receivers or board exit/TTL. A partner can reroute a pulse while it travels, deny a turn by clamping, or restore energy at a distant pump.",
    "observation_access": "All board geometry and dynamic fields are public. All entity visibility masks are true; the pulse active mask indicates whether a moving pulse exists. The policy receives all public dynamic coordinates, attributes and event flags, plus its role index. The static floor map is public."
